      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspected Fresenius Kabi USA LLC (FEI 1450022) on 2020-05-18 and classified it OAI, 364 days before the 2021-05-17 shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second OAI inspection at the same plant ended 2022-06-30, 409 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification letters for those inspections were dated 2024-05-22 and 2024-04-30, well after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A VAI inspection ended 2023-08-24 with a classification letter dated 2023-10-31, 897 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current supply at Corvale sites uses Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. product (NDC 00143920910) manufactured at HIKMA FARMACÊUTICA (PORTUGAL).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E4", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to transfer 2 vials of 20 mg/mL, 20 mL from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East from 8.1 to 9 days on hand while Corvale Lakeside remains above two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
